## Authority boundary

Schema inference, generation, MCP exposure, policy evaluation, and diffing do not carry ambient execution authority. `emit` is allowed only against an explicitly configured test receiver. `live-check` reaches ALIVE only after telemetry from the exact admitted subject is observed and assessed.

## Release gate

1. `weaver registry check -r . --v2 -p policies --future`
2. `weaver registry package -r . --v2 -p policies -o ./dist`
3. `weaver registry diff --baseline-registry <released-registry> -r . --v2`
4. Run the real instrumented integration/e2e path with `weaver registry live-check --registry . --v2 --fail-on violation`.
5. Preserve the packaged publication manifest and live-check report as release evidence.
